#{{AIHEADER}}:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="lib/**, config/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- Elixir 1.16+ (fill in exact version)
- OTP 26+
- Phoenix 1.7+

BUILD:
- mix compile
- mix format --check-formatted
- mix credo --strict
- mix dialyzer (if Dialyxir configured)

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- mix format is law — never hand-format
- Credo warnings treated as errors in CI
- Use @spec typespecs on public functions
- Prefer pattern matching over conditionals
- Context modules (Phoenix contexts) as the API boundary — no direct Repo calls from controllers
- Use with for multi-step operations that can fail

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No Repo calls outside of context modules (or explicitly documented exceptions)
- No secrets in source — use runtime.exs + environment variables
- No IO.inspect() / IO.puts() in production code
- No catch-all rescue clauses without logging

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: generated migrations in flight, priv/repo/migrations/ when migrating, etc.)
